## Write a function that checks a string for all unique characters.

### Response
function uniqueCharacters(string) { 

    let unique = true; 

    for (let i = 0; i < string.length; i++) { 
        for (let j = i + 1; j < string.length; j++) { 
            if (string[i] == string[j]) { 
                unique = false; 
            } 
        } 
    } 

    return unique; 
}

## Write a code snippet to implement the algorithm described in the text.

### Input
Create a function to generate the nth Fibonacci number.

### Response
def fibonacci(n):
    if n == 0:
        return 0
    elif n == 1:
        return 1
    else:
        return fibonacci(n-1) + fibonacci(n-2)

